    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8bc29de0e51f90be65b992dd6cedc050.poster.avif?t=1714370862\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8bc29de0e51f90be65b992dd6cedc050.webm?t=1714370862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8bc29de0e51f90be65b992dd6cedc050.mp4?t=1714370862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this game, an exciting journey into the world of mysteries, adventures and dangers awaits you. You will take on the role of a brave explorer who goes to unknown places in order to reveal its secrets and in the end tries to return home.<br><br>Different locations, from seemingly safe forests to ancient castles, each of which hides its secrets and dangers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/925ff16a04a5e21e52febb4820aebf37.avif?t=1714370862\" width=600 height=248 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8e8800c82a1c35dee067bf8699fbd01e.avif?t=1714370862\" width=600 height=248 /></span><br><br>You will need to craft potions, bombs, and other items to go through various traps and solve puzzles. Be prepared for encounters with zombies and tricky inventory items, some are just waiting to destroy you!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/a8395f9258e142cdf911f6bcd412408c.avif?t=1714370862\" width=600 height=248 /></span><br><br>Choose your equipment and materials wisely to unlock or activate specific items. Create weapons and proceed with caution at each step. Not everything is visible at first glance; this game is designed for people who are ready to challenge themselves.<br><br>But this is exactly what makes it intriguing, isn't it?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8bc29de0e51f90be65b992dd6cedc050.poster.avif?t=1714370862\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8bc29de0e51f90be65b992dd6cedc050.webm?t=1714370862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8bc29de0e51f90be65b992dd6cedc050.mp4?t=1714370862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this game, an exciting journey into the world of mysteries, adventures and dangers awaits you. You will take on the role of a brave explorer who goes to unknown places in order to reveal its secrets and in the end tries to return home.<br><br>Different locations, from seemingly safe forests to ancient castles, each of which hides its secrets and dangers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/925ff16a04a5e21e52febb4820aebf37.avif?t=1714370862\" width=600 height=248 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/8e8800c82a1c35dee067bf8699fbd01e.avif?t=1714370862\" width=600 height=248 /></span><br><br>You will need to craft potions, bombs, and other items to go through various traps and solve puzzles. Be prepared for encounters with zombies and tricky inventory items, some are just waiting to destroy you!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897840/extras/a8395f9258e142cdf911f6bcd412408c.avif?t=1714370862\" width=600 height=248 /></span><br><br>Choose your equipment and materials wisely to unlock or activate specific items. Create weapons and proceed with caution at each step. Not everything is visible at first glance; this game is designed for people who are ready to challenge themselves.<br><br>But this is exactly what makes it intriguing, isn't it?",
